        ":question/problem": "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{4}} \\frac{- 6 x \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)}}{2 \\tan{\\left(4 x^{2} \\right)} + 3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}",
